  "purpose": "(Clinical Focus: Concepts used to represent a person’s self-identified and socially acknowledged gender. These concepts reflect gender identity and are distinct from those used to describe sexual orientation (i.e., who a person is attracted to).),(Data Element Scope: Gender identity),(Inclusion Criteria: Concepts that can represent a type of gender.),(Exclusion Criteria: Concepts used to describe a person's sexual orientation.)",
